  message: "Closed in PR #3667 (merged at bf761dbf35). jni_lookup switched to dict[str, list[Symbol]] indexed under both short ClassName.method and FQ package.ClassName.method keys; cross-package short-name collisions pick deterministic-by-id with confidence=0.5 + meta['disambiguation_fallback']=True. +3 property tests (single match, multi-package short collision, FQ-form disambiguation). Coverage 100%, L4 gate clean."  # 8eba
